{"content_hash": "3eb89e2f5809e405", "version_id": 884, "article_id": 89, "level_code": "en_b2", "lang": "en", "level": 4, "level_label": "B2 中高级", "title": "Nvidia adds DLSS presets for 19 games in new app update", "title_zh": "英伟达新版本为19款游戏加入DLSS优设", "has_translation": true, "topic": "tech", "source": "ithome", "source_url": "https://www.ithome.com/1/023/068.htm", "image": {"type": "photo", "url": "https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1719763031152-e9a4bcb12a3e?ixid=M3wxMDk3Mzk1fDB8MXxzZWFyY2h8Nnx8YXBwJTIwZGxzc3xlbnwwfDB8fHwxNzkzOTI5NDkwfDA&ixlib=rb-4.1.0&w=1600&q=75&fm=jpg&fit=max", "provider": "unsplash", "credit": "Photo by Indra Projects on Unsplash", "author": "Indra Projects", "credit_url": "https://unsplash.com/@indraprojects?utm_source=daily-english-news&utm_medium=referral", "source": "Unsplash", "source_url": "https://unsplash.com/photos/a-close-up-of-a-computer-screen-with-many-different-app-icons-S4QZnvK5Mvg?utm_source=daily-english-news&utm_medium=referral", "fallback": {"type": "gradient", "from": "hsl(9, 42%, 62%)", "to": "hsl(47, 46%, 48%)", "label": "TECH", "seed": "0171d0c216a0"}}, "published_date": "2026-11-06", "word_count": 202, "reading_minutes": 1.0, "lead": "Nvidia has released version 11.0.9.585 of its NVIDIA App, bringing DLSS presets to 19 games and new optimal settings profiles to six more. The update follows two earlier releases that added bigger features.", "lead_zh": "英伟达发布了 NVIDIA App 11.0.9.585 版本，为19款游戏带来 DLSS 优设，并为另外6款游戏新增最佳设置配置文件。此前已发布两个加入更多功能的版本。", "preview": "The new version mainly targets game support rather than new tools. Among the 19 titles that now receive DLSS presets are PUBG: BATTLEGROUNDS", "preview_zh": "新版本的重点主要是游戏支持，而不是新增工具。此次获得 DLSS 优设的19款游戏包括《绝地求生：大逃杀》《巫师3：狂猎》《龙之信条2》和《应征入伍》。根据更新说明，玩家可以在应用的“图形”>“程序设置”>“驱动程序设置”中找到 DLSS 相关选项。", "has_audio": true, "audio": {"id": 867, "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/89/en_b2.mp3", "duration": 85.125, "size_bytes": 511776, "engine": "kokoro", "voice": "af_heart", "word_count": 231, "has_timeline": true, "alternates": [{"voice": "af_bella", "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/89/en_b2_af_bella.mp3", "duration": 87.0, "size_bytes": 523008, "engine": "kokoro", "word_count": 231, "has_timeline": true, "timeline_url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/timeline/89/en_b2_af_bella.json"}, {"voice": "am_michael", "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/89/en_b2_am_michael.mp3", "duration": 92.675, "size_bytes": 556992, "engine": "kokoro", "word_count": 231, "has_timeline": true, "timeline_url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/timeline/89/en_b2_am_michael.json"}, {"voice": "bf_emma", "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/89/en_b2_bf_emma.mp3", "duration": 80.15, "size_bytes": 481824, "engine": "kokoro", "word_count": 231, "has_timeline": true, "timeline_url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/timeline/89/en_b2_bf_emma.json"}, {"voice": "bm_george", "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/89/en_b2_bm_george.mp3", "duration": 85.1, "size_bytes": 511488, "engine": "kokoro", "word_count": 231, "has_timeline": true, "timeline_url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/timeline/89/en_b2_bm_george.json"}]}, "detail_url": "https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/chjam12301-sys/news-etl@07e7785/content/data/versions/884.json", "paragraphs": ["The new version mainly targets game support rather than new tools. Among the 19 titles that now receive DLSS presets are PUBG: BATTLEGROUNDS, The Witcher 3: Wild Hunt, Dragon's Dogma 2 and Enlisted. Players can find the DLSS options in the app under Graphics, then Program Settings and Driver Settings, according to the release notes.", "Six games also gain an optimal settings profile, which lets the app choose balanced graphics options automatically. These are AION 2, Aniimo, Control Resonant, EA SPORTS FC 27, Gears of War: E-Day and Star Wars: Galactic Racer. Such profiles are aimed at users who want a quick setup without adjusting each setting by hand.", "The update arrives after two earlier releases with more substantial changes. The main 11.0.9 version added DLSS 4.5 ray reconstruction support and introduced per-game Resizable BAR controls. A later build, 11.0.9.565, added support for RTX Spark and statistics for CPU clock speed, power draw and temperature.", "Nvidia has been steadily expanding the app since it replaced GeForce Experience, and each release tends to add support for upcoming titles ahead of their launch. The company has not said when the next version will arrive, but further game profiles are expected as new releases approach."], "paragraphs_zh": ["新版本的重点主要是游戏支持，而不是新增工具。此次获得 DLSS 优设的19款游戏包括《绝地求生：大逃杀》《巫师3：狂猎》《龙之信条2》和《应征入伍》。根据更新说明，玩家可以在应用的“图形”>“程序设置”>“驱动程序设置”中找到 DLSS 相关选项。", "另有6款游戏新增“最佳设置”配置文件，让应用自动选择均衡的画质选项。这6款是《永恒之塔2》《伊莫》《控制：共振》《EA SPORTS FC 27》《战争机器：事变日》和《星球大战：银河赛车手》。这类配置文件面向希望快速完成设置、不想逐项手动调整的用户。", "本次更新之前，已有两个版本带来更实质的变化。11.0.9 主版本新增 DLSS 4.5 光线重建支持，并引入针对单款游戏的 Resizable BAR 控制选项。之后的 11.0.9.565 版本则加入对 RTX Spark 的支持，以及 CPU 时钟频率、功耗和温度等统计数据。", "自从取代 GeForce Experience 以来，英伟达一直在稳步扩充这款应用，每次更新往往会在新游戏发售前提前加入支持。公司尚未透露下一个版本的时间，但随着新作临近，预计还会有更多游戏配置文件推出。"], "body": "The new version mainly targets game support rather than new tools. Among the 19 titles that now receive DLSS presets are PUBG: BATTLEGROUNDS, The Witcher 3: Wild Hunt, Dragon's Dogma 2 and Enlisted. Players can find the DLSS options in the app under Graphics, then Program Settings and Driver Settings, according to the release notes.\n\nSix games also gain an optimal settings profile, which lets the app choose balanced graphics options automatically. These are AION 2, Aniimo, Control Resonant, EA SPORTS FC 27, Gears of War: E-Day and Star Wars: Galactic Racer. Such profiles are aimed at users who want a quick setup without adjusting each setting by hand.\n\nThe update arrives after two earlier releases with more substantial changes. The main 11.0.9 version added DLSS 4.5 ray reconstruction support and introduced per-game Resizable BAR controls. A later build, 11.0.9.565, added support for RTX Spark and statistics for CPU clock speed, power draw and temperature.\n\nNvidia has been steadily expanding the app since it replaced GeForce Experience, and each release tends to add support for upcoming titles ahead of their launch. The company has not said when the next version will arrive, but further game profiles are expected as new releases approach.", "body_zh": "新版本的重点主要是游戏支持，而不是新增工具。此次获得 DLSS 优设的19款游戏包括《绝地求生：大逃杀》《巫师3：狂猎》《龙之信条2》和《应征入伍》。根据更新说明，玩家可以在应用的“图形”>“程序设置”>“驱动程序设置”中找到 DLSS 相关选项。\n\n另有6款游戏新增“最佳设置”配置文件，让应用自动选择均衡的画质选项。这6款是《永恒之塔2》《伊莫》《控制：共振》《EA SPORTS FC 27》《战争机器：事变日》和《星球大战：银河赛车手》。这类配置文件面向希望快速完成设置、不想逐项手动调整的用户。\n\n本次更新之前，已有两个版本带来更实质的变化。11.0.9 主版本新增 DLSS 4.5 光线重建支持，并引入针对单款游戏的 Resizable BAR 控制选项。之后的 11.0.9.565 版本则加入对 RTX Spark 的支持，以及 CPU 时钟频率、功耗和温度等统计数据。\n\n自从取代 GeForce Experience 以来，英伟达一直在稳步扩充这款应用，每次更新往往会在新游戏发售前提前加入支持。公司尚未透露下一个版本的时间，但随着新作临近，预计还会有更多游戏配置文件推出。", "text": "The new version mainly targets game support rather than new tools. Among the 19 titles that now receive DLSS presets are PUBG: BATTLEGROUNDS, The Witcher 3: Wild Hunt, Dragon's Dogma 2 and Enlisted. Players can find the DLSS options in the app under Graphics, then Program Settings and Driver Settings, according to the release notes. Six games also gain an optimal settings profile, which lets the app choose balanced graphics options automatically. These are AION 2, Aniimo, Control Resonant, EA SPORTS FC 27, Gears of War: E-Day and Star Wars: Galactic Racer. Such profiles are aimed at users who want a quick setup without adjusting each setting by hand. The update arrives after two earlier releases with more substantial changes. The main 11.0.9 version added DLSS 4.5 ray reconstruction support and introduced per-game Resizable BAR controls. A later build, 11.0.9.565, added support for RTX Spark and statistics for CPU clock speed, power draw and temperature. Nvidia has been steadily expanding the app since it replaced GeForce Experience, and each release tends to add support for upcoming titles ahead of their launch. The company has not said when the next version will arrive, but further game profiles are expected as new releases approach.", "vocab": [{"word": "preset", "pos": "noun", "zh": "预设", "note": "指预先配置好的参数方案", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "optimal", "pos": "adj", "zh": "最佳的", "note": "常与 settings、performance 搭配", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "profile", "pos": "noun", "zh": "配置文件", "note": "此处指一组自动应用的设置", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "release notes", "pos": "phrase", "zh": "更新说明", "note": "软件发布时附带的说明文档", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "substantial", "pos": "adj", "zh": "实质性的；重大的", "note": "形容变化、改进幅度较大", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "ray reconstruction", "pos": "phrase", "zh": "光线重建", "note": "DLSS 的一项图像增强技术", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "statistics", "pos": "noun", "zh": "统计数据", "note": "常用复数形式", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "expand", "pos": "verb", "zh": "扩充；扩展", "note": "expand support for 表示扩大支持范围", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "ahead of", "pos": "phrase", "zh": "在……之前", "note": "ahead of launch 即发售前", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "by hand", "pos": "phrase", "zh": "手动地", "note": "adjust by hand 表示手工调整", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "aim at", "pos": "phrase", "zh": "针对；面向", "note": "be aimed at users 表示面向某类用户", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "steadily", "pos": "adv", "zh": "稳步地", "note": "修饰持续渐进的动作", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}], "fetched_at": "2026-11-06T01:44:48.078996", "timeline": [{"i": 0, "w": "The", "s": 0.275, "e": 0.35, "sm": 275, "em": 349, "cs": 0, "ce": 3, "si": 0}, {"i": 1, "w": "new", "s": 0.35, "e": 0.525, "sm": 350, "em": 524, "cs": 4, "ce": 7, "si": 0}, {"i": 2, "w": "version", "s": 0.525, "e": 0.95, "sm": 525, "em": 949, "cs": 8, "ce": 15, "si": 0}, {"i": 3, "w": "mainly", "s": 0.95, "e